<section class="home-ed-process" aria-labelledby="home-ed-process-title">
  <div class="container home-ed-process__lead"><div><p class="home-ed-kicker">Our process</p><h2 id="home-ed-process-title">The portal is only<br>the beginning.</h2><p>When a record isn’t easy to find, we keep going—searching, calling, and following up until we have a file, not just a dead end.</p></div><figure><img src="/images/studio/home-research-desk-v1.webp" alt="Property research desk with a site plan, agency correspondence, parcel notes, and an archival folio" width="1536" height="960" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
  <ol class="container home-ed-process__steps"><li><span>01</span><h3>Search online</h3><p>We search public systems and county portals.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Find the custodian</h3><p>When it’s not online, we identify and contact the right office.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Follow through</h3><p>We send a focused request to the responsible public office and track the response.</p></li><li><span>04</span><h3>Explain the evidence</h3><p>We translate the source into a clear, practical next step.</p></li></ol>
</section>

<section class="home-ed-case" aria-labelledby="home-ed-case-title">
