<section class="home-ed-self" id="self-serve-records" aria-labelledby="home-ed-self-title"><div class="container home-ed-self__grid"><div><p class="home-ed-kicker">Self-serve alternative</p><h2 id="home-ed-self-title">Research it yourself.</h2><p>Use our source-backed tools if you would rather trace the route yourself. Your address is not stored by SepticPath.</p><nav aria-label="Self-serve research tools"><a href="/septic-record-finder/">Find your county route <span>→</span></a><a href="/septic-records-request-builder/#records-request-builder">Build an official request <span>→</span></a><a href="/septic-record-brief-example/#real-cases">See completed investigations <span>→</span></a><a href="/states/">Browse state guides <span>→</span></a></nav></div><div>@template.tags.addressRecordFinder(finderId = "home-address-record-finder", eyebrow = "Property route", heading = "Find the public record path", intro = "Enter the property address to identify the county and likely official record source.", pageHeading = false, totalCountyRouteCount = totalCountyRouteCount, minimal = true)</div></div>
