ic-permit-process/#design-final-case">Design and final approval compared <span>→</span></a><a href="/septic-tank-location-records/#addition-file-case">Addition planning traced to the old drawing <span>→</span></a><a href="/septic-permit-search-by-address/#old-address-case">Old address matched to the current parcel <span>→</span></a></nav></div></details><details><summary><span><strong>Search by county instead</strong><small>Use this when you do not have the full property address.</small></span><span>Browse ${totalCountyRouteCount} county paths</span></summary>@template.tags.countyFinder(countyFinderLinks = countyFinderLinks, finderId = "home-county-finder", eyebrow = "County search", heading = "Search by county or state.", body = "Open the local permit, records request, parcel, as-built, or inspection-letter route.", sourceContext = "home_county_finder", totalCountyRouteCount = totalCountyRouteCount)</details><p>Back from the official site? Keep the property details together and continue with the next available route.</p></div>
